### 1. Root route
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### 3. Get single book by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

### 4. Search books by title
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=Gatsby

### 5. Sort books by price descending
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC

### 6. Filter by price range
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?min_price=300&max_price=500

### 7. Pagination (limit and offset)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?limit=2&offset=0

### 8. Add a new book (POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone",
  "author": "J.K. Rowling",
  "price": 550
}

### 9. Update an existing book (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby (Special Edition)",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "price": 499
}

### 10. Delete a book by ID (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/3/

